0242: the bridge holds a DMS SET_OPERATING_MODE answer of QMI_ERR_DEVICE_NOT_READY and sends the request
again each second, for at most 8 s (ABM's timeout is 10 s). cell6: CommCenter's one online request came at
47.7 s, while the modem was still loading its MCFG files (0241), and was never repeated.

